voxtype-doubao
==============

Standalone OpenAI-compatible proxy for the free Doubao (豆包) web ASR service,
designed for [voxtype](https://github.com/peteonrails/voxtype).

It does not require an official Volcengine API key and does not depend on
[doubao-murmur](https://github.com/lilong7676/doubao-murmur) at runtime.

